# Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong: "... You may cast that card without paying its mana cost. Do this only once each turn."
# "This ability triggers only if its source's controller has not yet taken the indicated action that turn" (CR 603.2h), and
# the ruling: once you cast the top card, the ability won't trigger again that turn. Bot1 scries with the Planetarium and
# casts the Mox Jet on top for free; Displacer Kitten, seeing a noncreature spell cast, blinks the Planetarium, which comes
# back a new, untapped object (CR 400.7). Bot1 scries with it again: the top card is a castable Mox Ruby, but the
# Planetarium does not trigger - Bot1 has already cast a card with its ability this turn.

